   "text": "'First provable RO method' claim needs qualification",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "P1.24",
   "reviewer": "P1",
   "text": "Many typos and inconsistent notation",
   "minor": true
  },
  {
   "id": "P1.25",
   "reviewer": "P1",
   "text": "Eq. 6.6 and PRO inference hard to follow",
   "minor": true
  },
  {
   "id": "P1.26",
   "reviewer": "P1",
   "text": "Cognitive-science motivation loose",
   "minor": true
  },
  {
